@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!theme plain
title BrewLite — AWS EC2 và pipeline CD đã chuẩn bị
node "Thiết bị khách" {
 artifact "Browser / Next.js PWA" as Browser
}
cloud Internet
node "AWS EC2 Ubuntu 24.04\nap-southeast-2 · 3.107.247.123" as EC2 {
 node "Docker Compose: brewlite" {
  node "Caddy :80/:443\nTLS + filtered access log" as Caddy
  node "Next.js web :3000\nstandalone" as Web
  node "NestJS api :3001\nJWT / RBAC / mock payment" as API
  database "PostgreSQL 16 :5432\nkhông public port" as DB
  artifact "postgres_data\npersistent volume" as Volume
  artifact "uploads/\npersistent bind mount" as Upload
 }
 artifact "deploy/.env.production\nprivate runtime secrets" as Secrets
}
node "GitHub Actions\nCD prepared, chưa chạy nghiệm thu" as CI
cloud "GHCR\nimages tagged commit SHA\nprepared, chưa publish" as Registry
cloud "Gmail SMTP / VNPay Sandbox\nextensions" as External
Browser --> Internet : HTTPS
Internet --> Caddy : HTTPS :443
Caddy --> Web : internal HTTP :3000
Caddy --> API : /api/* HTTP :3001
API --> DB : internal PostgreSQL
DB --> Volume
API --> Upload
Secrets ..> API
CI --> Registry : build + push linux/amd64
CI --> EC2 : verified SSH :22\nproduction environment approval
Registry --> API : image pull
Registry --> Web : image pull
API --> External : TLS / HTTPS
note bottom of CI
Quality gates -> images -> registry -> approval -> backup
-> migration gate -> deploy -> HTTPS smoke.
Rollback image only when schema remains compatible.
end note
note bottom of EC2
GET /api/health, /api/products.
Local và CI dùng database tách biệt production.
UFW/SG/NACL chưa được sơ đồ này chứng nhận.
end note
@enduml
